      "refersTo": "rating-sheet",
      "description": "Paired sample numbers with visible coverage.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-sheet\"><h2>Adjusted sample rating</h2><div class=\"ds-pair\"><div class=\"ds-main\"><strong>4.00</strong><span>out of 5</span></div><div class=\"ds-original\"><span>Original sample</span><strong>4.50<small> / 5</small></strong></div></div><p>Illustrative values only; synthetic sample.</p></section>",
